"id":"08.02.04-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"吃了药不舒服，怎么办？","meaning_my":"ဆေးသောက်ပြီး နေမကောင်းဖြစ်ရင် ဘယ်လိုလုပ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S002","kind":"main","cn":"吃了以后头晕。","meaning_my":"ဆေးသောက်ပြီး ခေါင်းမူးနေတယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S003","kind":"main","cn":"我有点恶心。","meaning_my":"နည်းနည်း ပျို့နေတယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S004","kind":"main","cn":"吃了以后肚子疼。","meaning_my":"ဆေးသောက်ပြီး ဗိုက်နာနေတယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S005","kind":"main","cn":"吃了以后拉肚子。","meaning_my":"ဆေးသောက်ပြီး ဝမ်းလျှောနေတယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S006","kind":"main","cn":"身上很痒。","meaning_my":"တစ်ကိုယ်လုံး ယားနေတယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S006_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"吃药后才开始痒的吗？","meaning_my":"ဆေးသောက်ပြီးမှ ယားလာတာလား။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S006_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S007","kind":"main","cn":"吃了以后身上起疹子。","meaning_my":"ဆေးသောက်ပြီး ကိုယ်ပေါ်မှာ အဖုအပိမ့်တွေ ထွက်လာတယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S008","kind":"main","cn":"嘴唇有点肿。","meaning_my":"နှုတ်ခမ်း နည်းနည်း ရောင်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"如果伴有呼吸困难，要立即叫救护车。","meaning_my":"အသက်ရှူခက်တာပါ တွဲဖြစ်လာရင် လူနာတင်ကား ချက်ချင်း ခေါ်ပါ။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S009","kind":"main","cn":"吃了以后脸肿了。","meaning_my":"ဆေးသောက်ပြီး မျက်နှာ ရောင်လာတယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S010","kind":"main","cn":"喉咙有点紧。","meaning_my":"လည်ချောင်း တင်းကျပ်နေသလို ခံစားရတယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S011","kind":"main","cn":"吃药后喘不过气。","meaning_my":"ဆေးသောက်ပြီး အသက်ရှူမဝဘူး။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S011_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"马上叫救护车，可能是严重过敏。","meaning_my":"လူနာတင်ကား ချက်ချင်း ခေါ်ပါ၊ ပြင်းထန်တဲ့ ဓာတ်မတည့်မှု ဖြစ်နိုင်တယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S011_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S012","kind":"main","cn":"能帮我叫救护车吗？","meaning_my":"လူနာတင်ကား ခေါ်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S013","kind":"main","cn":"可能是严重过敏，快打120！","meaning_my":"ပြင်းထန်တဲ့ ဓာတ်မတည့်မှု ဖြစ်နိုင်တယ်၊ ၁၂၀ ကို ချက်ချင်း ဖုန်းဆက်ပါ။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S014","kind":"main","cn":"心跳有点快。","meaning_my":"နှလုံးခုန် နည်းနည်းမြန်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S015","kind":"main","cn":"头晕越来越厉害。","meaning_my":"ခေါင်းမူးတာ ပိုပိုဆိုးလာတယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S016","kind":"main","cn":"我好像吃错药了。","meaning_my":"ဆေးမှားသောက်မိသလိုပဲ။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S016_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"把药盒带上，马上联系医护人员。","meaning_my":"ဆေးဘူးကို ယူပြီး ဆရာဝန် ဒါမှမဟုတ် ကျန်းမာရေးဝန်ထမ်းကို ချက်ချင်း ဆက်သွယ်ပါ။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S016_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S016_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我可能吃错药了。","meaning_my":"ဆေးမှားသောက်မိတာ ဖြစ်နိုင်တယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S016_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S017","kind":"main","cn":"我不小心多吃了一次。","meaning_my":"မတော်တဆ ဆေးတစ်ကြိမ် ပိုသောက်မိသွားတယ်။","audio_file":"08.02.04-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.02.04-S017_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"把药名、剂量和服药时间告诉医生。","meaning_my":"ဆေးနာမည်၊ သောက်ထားတဲ့ပမာဏနဲ့ သောက်ခဲ့တဲ့အချိန်ကို ဆရာဝန်ကို ပြောပါ။","aud